   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[S39][[A40]CX[/A40]][/S39] [IMG41] The\n[I42]free[/I42]() function shall not modify [I43]errno[/I43] if [I44]ptr[/I44] is a null pointer or a pointer previously returned as if by\n[A45][I46]malloc[/I46]()[/A45] and not yet deallocated. [IMG47]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S39": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A40": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
