    "id": "p_00017",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "There is now no requirement for the implementation to support the inclusion of [I77]&lt;malloc.h&gt;[/I77].",
    "placeholders": {
